				"- 方块工厂的Boss们 &b(@bloc)&r"
				"- Eeeab's Mobs &b(@eee)&r"
				"- 地牢加载中 &b(@dungeonn)&r"
				"- 禁忌与奥术 &b(@forb)&r"
				"- 迎接你的战斗 &b(@mee)&r"
				"- 外层末地 &b(@out)&r"
				"- Mowzies Mobs &b(@mow)&r"
				"- Majrusz's Difficulty &b(@majr)&r"
				"- Alex's Caves &b(@ale)&r"
				"- 水产养殖 2 &b(@aquac)&r"
				"- 神秘遗产 &b(@eni)&r"
				"- 可驯服的野兽 &b(@tam)&r"
				""
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:10 align:center}"
				""
				"&eℹ 关于盾牌&r"
				""
